1
00:00:00,330 --> 00:00:05,280
November is my favorite month, and y'all,
it's not even my birthday,

2
00:00:05,387 --> 00:00:07,377
nor my wedding anniversary month.

3
00:00:07,453 --> 00:00:12,543
There's just something about crisp leaves
and sweater weather.

4
00:00:12,593 --> 00:00:15,843
Not too hot, not too cold, just right.

5
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,830
Now let me tell you why
November has my heart.

6
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:23,270
Orange and brown are my favorite colors. Yes!

7
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:28,670
And give me Thanksgiving! The turkey, cornbread
dressing, mustard greens, gumbo,

8
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:32,910
sweet potato pie, and pecan pie, y'all!

9
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,670
But beyond the food and cozy weather,

10
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:39,110
I'm just grateful for family,
everyday blessings,

11
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:43,090
and the trust people place in me
and my business.

12
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:46,870
So tell me, what makes November
special to you?
